---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import InquiryForm from "../components/InquiryForm.astro";
---
<Base
  title="Request a demo | Cyber Pirate Labs"
  description="Talk to Aaron about CPL Command Center and the workflow you want to organize. Request an early-access demo."
>
  <section class="page-intro contact-page">
    <div class="wrap contact-grid">
      <div class="contact-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Cyber Pirate Labs / Contact</p>
        <h1>Let’s put your<br />workflow<br /><span>under command.</span></h1>
        <p>Where does information get scattered? Which handoff needs a clearer next step? Tell Aaron about the work your team does.</p>
        <div class="contact-person"><span class="person-monogram" aria-hidden="true">AS</span><div><strong>Aaron Starrett</strong><span>Founder, Cyber Pirate Labs</span></div></div>
        <p class="contact-mail"><a href="mailto:AStarrett@cyberpiratelabs.com">AStarrett@cyberpiratelabs.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
        <p class="contact-note">Early access · Scope and timing discussed together</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/demo/">Explore the product preview <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <InquiryForm sourcePath="/contact/" />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
